This product includes architectural concepts inspired by — but no source code copied
from — the following open-source projects:

- AB Download Manager — Apache-2.0 — https://github.com/amir1376/ab-download-manager
    Blueprint for the segmented download engine (probe/plan/positioned writes,
    queue/priority/concurrency model, HLS part strategy). Concepts re-implemented
    from scratch in Kotlin for Android. Apache-2.0 is compatible with this
    project's GPL-3.0 distribution.

- Cloudstream (CS3) — GPL-3.0 — https://github.com/recloudstream/cloudstream
    Provider call-graph concept (search → load → loadLinks), host extractors and
    repo model. Our API is designed independently under the same license family.

- Mihon / Tachiyomi & Aniyomi — Apache-2.0 — repository-driven extension updates,
    user-centric install flow concepts.

- Kotatsu — GPL-3.0+ — parser/app separation concept, offline-first library model.

- Nuvio — GPL-3.0 — scriptable providers & subtitle fidelity (libass) goals.

- Stremio addons — manifest/resource protocol concept (docs/en/04, remote flavor).

